" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How It Works: From First Call to Closing &amp; Cash Back Rebate\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adabd04 e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"adabd04\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24abe4a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"24abe4a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"828\" height=\"552\" src=\"https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-1024x683.avif\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5877\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-1024x683.avif 1024w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-300x200.avif 300w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-768x512.avif 768w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-1536x1024.avif 1536w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-2048x1365.avif 2048w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-150x100.avif 150w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-488x326.avif 488w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 828px) 100vw, 828px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c36180 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8c36180\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"cash-back-intro-text01\">When you first contact a Grih cash back agent, you&#8217;ll have the chance to ask about the cash back rebate program and discuss your personal preferences, areas of interest, and any factors that might impact your home-buying plans. If you choose to move forward, your cash back agent will go over the &#8216;RECO Information Guide&#8217; with you. After signing, you&#8217;ll proceed to review and sign the &#8216;Buyer Designated Representation Agreement,&#8217; which details the cash back rebate, along with the &#8216;Buyer Not Non-Canadian Warranty&#8217; form.<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2307111 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2307111\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85e58e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"85e58e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Once the representation paperwork is finalized, your Grih cash back agent will begin a property search tailored to your needs or schedule showings if you already have properties in mind. When the perfect property is found, your agent will discuss an offer strategy and prepare the &#8216;Confirmation of Cooperation and Representation&#8217; form, confirming the commission paid by the listing brokerage, as well as the &#8216;Agreement of Purchase and Sale&#8217; to formalize the offer. Before signing the offer, your cash back agent will verify your ID as required by FINTRAC and the Proceeds of Crime (Money Laundering) and Terrorist Financing Act.<\/p><p>After the seller accepts the offer, the agreement will either be firm or subject to conditions such as inspection or mortgage financing approval. Once all conditions are met and the deal becomes firm, your lawyer will prepare the necessary documents to finalize the purchase and transfer the title on closing day.<\/p><p>Following closing, once Grih receives the co-operating commission from the listing brokerage, you will receive a cheque for the cash back rebate, and the transaction will be complete.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d0e9cb9 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d0e9cb9\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-606393c\" data-id=\"606393c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87f42f1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"87f42f1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac2de83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ac2de83\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Are Cash Back Rebates Considered Taxable Income? Does It Impact Land Transfer Tax? Does HST on New Homes Change for Buyers?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a88fdcc e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a88fdcc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-71b9c6e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"71b9c6e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>It is generally accepted that a cash back rebate on a home purchase is considered a price reduction, meaning no income tax is owed. However, if the home is later sold, this rebate could impact the capital gains tax owed to the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA). Since tax situations vary depending on individual circumstances and REALTORS\u00ae are not tax experts, it\u2019s recommended that buyers consult a tax professional regarding their specific cash back rebate.<\/p><p>In Ontario, buyers may be subject to Provincial Land Transfer Tax (PLTT), Municipal Land Transfer Tax (MLTT), and, for new homes, Harmonized Sales Tax (HST).<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d71c961 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d71c961\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"828\" height=\"552\" src=\"https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-1024x683.avif\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5877\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-1024x683.avif 1024w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-300x200.avif 300w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-768x512.avif 768w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-1536x1024.avif 1536w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-2048x1365.avif 2048w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-150x100.avif 150w, https:\/\/grih.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c-488x326.avif 488w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 828px) 100vw, 828px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47d065c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"47d065c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section id=\"example\" class=\"fullwidth margin-top-40 margin-bottom-40 padding-top-60 padding-bottom-40\" data-background-color=\"#f9f9f9\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div id=\"cash-back-realtor-worth-faq\" class=\"col-md-12\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div id=\"example-text01\"><p>None of these taxes are impacted by cash back rebates, as they are calculated based on the value of the transaction. However, rebates can potentially lower the negotiated purchase price, which may influence these taxes. For advice on how to navigate this, buyers should consult their designated cash back realtor.<\/p><p>Have questions about cash back rebates? Text us at +1 905 872 6870, or reach out to one of our cash back agents directly.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/d