t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1575f20 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1575f20\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cd593d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3cd593d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>As cash back rebates become more popular in real estate transactions, new financial services may allow buyers to access these funds before closing, though interest fees may apply.<\/p><p>There\u2019s no catch! The rising cost of housing compared to wages has made it possible to offer significant cash back rebates while still allowing real estate agents to earn competitive compensation. Additionally, advancements in technology, such as the internet and electronic signatures, have made the process more efficient, enabling REALTORS\u00ae to serve more clients simultaneously while maintaining high service levels.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ca5283c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ca5283c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bbd9e3f\" data-id=\"bbd9e3f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b